<div type="letter">
<pb facs="1362036" n="1"/>
  <opener><salute><lb/><abbr>Ill.<hi rend="sup">mo</hi></abbr> <abbr>s.<hi rend="sup">e</hi></abbr> <choice><abbr>Prone</abbr><expan>Patrone</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>Colmo</abbr><expan>Colendissimo</expan></choice></salute></opener>
  <p>Ritornato da <rs key="place_GEO-3164603" type="place">Venezia</rs> trovo il pregiatissimo
      <lb/>suo <rs type="letter">foglio</rs>; e le rendo infinite grazie,
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#per">&#42833;</g></orig><reg>per</reg></choice>che si sia compiacciuta avvisarmi il
      <lb/>suo viaggio. Io hò di che supplicarla:
      <lb/>che mi conservi in ogni luogo la
      <lb/>pretiosissima sua grazia, e che aggradira
      <lb/>il vero rispetto, con cui sono</p>
  <closer>Di <choice><abbr>V<supplied>.</supplied></abbr><expan>Vostra</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>S<supplied>.</supplied></abbr><expan>Signoria</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>Ill.<hi rend="sup">ma</hi></abbr><expan>Illustrissima</expan></choice>
      <lb/><choice><abbr>Di.<hi rend="sup">mo</hi></abbr><expan>Divotissimo</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>Obbl.<hi rend="sup">mo</hi></abbr><expan>Obbligatissimo</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>ser.<hi rend="sup">re</hi></abbr><expan>servitore</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>v.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr><expan>vero</expan></choice>
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-11887733X" type="person">Giovanni Poleni</rs></closer>
<pb facs="1362037" n="2" type="empty"/>
